  "h3",
  "3",
  "Who we ask matters more than what we ask"
 ],
 [
  "p",
  "This section looks at donor value before agency fees. The agencies charge very different rates and recruit very different ages, so a figure after fees would mix the two together. Costs come in section 4."
 ],
